{"shortDescription":"VANCOUVER, BC, Sept. 10, 2026 /CNW/ -- Wall Financial Corporation (the \"Company\") released its operating results and financial statements for the six months ended July 31, 2026. The Company recorded net earnings and comprehensive income attributable to shareholders of the Company for the six months…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["VANCOUVER, BC, Sept. 10, 2026 /CNW/ -- Wall Financial Corporation (the \"Company\") released its operating results and financial statements for the six months ended July 31, 2026. The Company recorded net earnings and comprehensive income attributable to shareholders of the Company for the six months ended July 31, 2026 of $21,572,285 or $0.67 per share compared to $18,307,339 or $0.57 per share in the same period of the prior year."]},{"type":"p","children":["Revenue and earnings from the Company's hotels increased due to higher average daily rates. Stabilized earnings from rental apartment operations decreased slightly. Revenues and earnings from the Company's development operations decreased due to fewer condominium unit sales in the current period."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Three months ended July 31"]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Six months ended July 31"]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Statements of Earnings"]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cel